WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.655
The final activity combines the major ideas

00:00:02.682 --> 00:00:06.842
from Module 2 Choose a familiar two-table

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:09.606
domain such as rooms and reservations customers

00:00:09.698 --> 00:00:14.150
and orders or courses and registrations Define

00:00:14.177 --> 00:00:15.795
the purpose and row grain of both

00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:20.058
tables before writing SQL Give each table

00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:21.914
a primary key and connect them with

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.245
one foreign key Add required columns with

00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:26.864
NOT NULL and at least one CHECK

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.553
constraint Insert valid sample rows and confirm

00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:34.797
that they work If you are ready

00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:36.994
for more add a protected natural key

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.165
a third table or junction table a

00:00:39.178 --> 00:00:43.641
deletion rule and an invalid-data test Work

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:46.444
incrementally copy a small known pattern rename

00:00:46.457 --> 00:00:48.352
it for your domain change one piece

00:00:48.365 --> 00:00:50.010
at a time and run after every

00:00:50.023 --> 00:00:50.536
change
